<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Tuesday slaughter steers, heifers and Holstein steers continued steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Choice 2-4 1000-1400 lbs 62.50-64.30. Select and Choice 2-3 1100-1400 lbs 61.00-62.50. Select 2-3 1000-1400 lbs 58.00-61.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Few Choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 62.00-63.00. Select 2-3 1000-1200 lbs 60.00-62.00. Select 2-3 1100-1470 lbs 55.75-60.00.</p>
</text>
